n* Bump version to 1.25.4. by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1634\n* Keep machine execs alive when the image's workload exits by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1632\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/compare/v1.25.3...v1.25.4","mentions_count":3}
